## Configure

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in the required values.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run locally

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

## Run with Docker Compose

```bash
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up --build
```

Verify the app:

```bash
curl http://localhost:8000/health
```

The agent can be extended through `app.agent` and `app.tools`.

